#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/0-index.md:1
#: efcf6b9bb6f1487da18429070e334517
msgid "Simulation Reference"
msgstr "仿真参考"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/0-index.md:3
#: 50577259f6c64fd48ae6eaf0ffe12456
msgid ""
"This section is the reference for the simulation backends and their USD "
"assets. It explains what each piece is, how the pieces fit, and which "
"parameters or layouts are in the current trees. Step-by-step start, "
"launch, and first checks live in the How-To pages."
msgstr "这一节是仿真后端和 USD 资产的参考：每块是什么、怎么拼在一起，以及当前树里的参数和布局。逐步启动、launch 和第一次检查写在 How-To 页面。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/0-index.md:5
#: 9ac12d5763ca4a998d6934bf0efc1857
msgid ""
"**FaSim** is NVIDIA Isaac Sim plus the same ROS 2 运控 stack used on the "
"real robot, so motion can match hardware while the sim supplies ground "
"truth. FaSim-Isaac is more than a place to open a USD: it also installs "
"the OmniGraph extensions that start 运控 inside Sim and that drive a swerve"
" chassis."
msgstr "**FaSim** 是 NVIDIA Isaac Sim，再加上真机同一套 ROS 2 运控，所以运动可以跟硬件对齐，同时仿真还能给出真值。FaSim-Isaac 不只是用来打开一份 USD：它还会安装 OmniGraph 扩展，在 Sim 里启动运控，并驱动舵轮底盘。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/0-index.md:7
#: 3114c584722148739f7cd1992c16a86d
msgid "Isaac Sim reading order"
msgstr "Isaac Sim 阅读顺序"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/0-index.md:9
#: 8a4774766fba48f2a9d0febd47ad4bbb
msgid ""
"Use the pages in this order. Each one points at a specific section when "
"you need more detail; they do not repeat the full mechanism."
msgstr "按这个顺序读。需要细节时，各页会链到具体小节，而不是把整套机制再讲一遍。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/0-index.md:11
#: 8c91bb12d269422a95e638f5e8f7efef
msgid ""
"**Prepare the machine and start Sim** — [Isaac "
"Sim](../../2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md): `./init.sh`, "
"`./run.sh`, and the first ROS 2 connection."
msgstr "**准备机器并启动 Sim** — [Isaac Sim](../../2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md)：`./init.sh`、`./run.sh`，以及第一次接入 ROS 2。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/0-index.md:12
#: ef248e24fda9425eb47d1f2d712b07e4
msgid ""
"**Robot USD assets** — [robot_usds](3-robot_usds.md): the `robots/` tree,"
" its git submodules, and public versus private checkout."
msgstr "**机器人 USD 资产** — [robot_usds](3-robot_usds.md)：`robots/` 目录、其中的 git 子模块，以及公开与私有检出。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/0-index.md:13
#: 1fac824389e24c6197fdf51bf3b741f5
msgid ""
"**FaSim extensions** — [FaSim-Isaac](2-fasim_isaac.md): how the `isaac` /"
" `isaac_sim` hardware keys differ from the Kit extensions, then the [ROS "
"2 Control extension](2-fasim_isaac.md#ros-2-control-extension) and the [swerve"
" extension](2-fasim_isaac.md#swerve-extension)."
msgstr "**FaSim 扩展** — [FaSim-Isaac](2-fasim_isaac.md)：`isaac` / `isaac_sim` 硬件键和 Kit 扩展有何不同，然后是 [ROS 2 Control 扩展](2-fasim_isaac.md#ros-2-control-extension) 和 [舵轮扩展](2-fasim_isaac.md#swerve-extension)。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/0-index.md:14
#: 3d9803df1b2a42c2af8ee053f5836cfe
msgid ""
"**Scenes and project layout** — [Environment assets](5-env_assets.md): "
"public scenes, ArtVIP / LabUtopia components, and private project USD "
"(including where `robot.yaml` currently lives)."
msgstr "**场景与项目布局** — [环境资产](5-env_assets.md)：公开场景、ArtVIP / LabUtopia 组件，以及私有项目 USD（包括 `robot.yaml` 目前在哪）。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/0-index.md:15
#: 6a8a27368e844cffaec5d205bcf7fcc0
msgid ""
"**Run, check, and debug** — [When it "
"fails](../../2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md#when-it-fails) on the "
"How-To page. Clock and TF details stay in [Clock](2-fasim_isaac.md#clock) and [TF](2-fasim_isaac.md#tf)."
msgstr "**运行、检查和排障** — How-To 页的 [出了问题](../../2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md#when-it-fails)。时钟和 TF 的细节仍在 [时钟](2-fasim_isaac.md#clock) 和 [TF](2-fasim_isaac.md#tf)。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/0-index.md:17
#: 800fb9353c1844a7b9d702099c6a8e5a
msgid ""
"Gazebo is a separate backend: [Gazebo](1-gazebo.md), with steps in "
"[Gazebo Simulation](../../2-how_to/2-simulation/3-gazebo_sim.md)."
msgstr "Gazebo 是另一套后端：[Gazebo](1-gazebo.md)，步骤见 [Gazebo 仿真](../../2-how_to/2-simulation/3-gazebo_sim.md)。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/simulation/0-index.md:19
#: 715fb438e8bf4fbf811ec6dfd1fd2088
msgid ""
"Isaac **datagen** (USD → orchestration → LeRobot export, not Gazebo): "
"[Synthetic Data](../../2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/0-index.md)."
msgstr ""
"Isaac **数据采集**（USD → 编排 → LeRobot 导出，不含 "
"Gazebo）：[合成数据](../../2-how_to/7-synthetic_data/0-index.md)。"

